{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Strike is a tactical sci\u2011fi card battler where you collect cards, build and optimize decks, and duel against other players as well as artificial intelligence. The gameplay focuses on strategic planning, card synergies, and adapting to your opponent\u2019s tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 300 unique cards divided into 4 factions and 7 card types \u2014 including ground and space units, actions, equipment, traps, garrisons, and turrets \u2014 every battle offers new strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your decks to fit your playstyle, combine cards for powerful effects, and make every turn count. Battles take place both against AI opponents and in direct PvP duels, where careful decision-making determines victory.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987410?t=1771082871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/a38823f0d33eff5deb74d8c7a6eee7f181210433/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771082871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/90ca9ac251924e029d3de15b4f8fc735b292c06d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771082871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987410/90ca9ac251924e029d3de15b4f8fc735b292c06d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771082871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Strike is a tactical sci\u2011fi card battler where you collect cards, build and optimize decks, and duel against other players as well as artificial intelligence. The gameplay focuses on strateg